  "details": "When the radial menu is opened with R, all screen space camera breaks.\n\nYou can reproduce it here:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_529dbcdc-a5af-48bb-bc6c-edb42d7ab3ec\n\nEnter the poweryacht and go to the \"cockpit\". Press R to open the radial menu. The screen turns black and the text on the map disappears (based on screen space cameras which renders into render textures). Select something in the radial menu and press R again to close it. The screen stays black and will not work again.\n\nSeems to be a old bug which appears again:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/opening-camera-through-radial-menu-forever-disables-screen-space-canvases",
